  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Market Access for a Sustainable Community Livelihoods in Warrap State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will continue to support and build up the gains made in a Market System Development (MSD) project which is currently being implemented in Warrap State. The project was to deliver an exit strategy for CN SPA1 project, and is ending at the end of December 2025.  CTP conducted a market systems development and value chain analysis in the project target locations and is currently implementing the recommended actions/strategies.   The transition is focusing on 3 outcomes: (1) Supporting access to affordable finance and credit; (2) Promoting aggregation opportunities and producer collectives; and (3) Supporting access to inputs (tools and seeds) and machineries.</narrative>
  </description>
